      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MOO MOVE (1) jumped wide and had a clear run last start, leading all the way to score (22.63) at this track in a Grade 5 over 400m. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. GOES BANG (3) goes very well this trip starting 13 times for six wins and two minors. Recorded a 2 length win (22.54) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Can feature with the right run. RIGATONI MONELLI (2) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 400m behind Mabel Monelli (23.04) in a Grade 4. Is yet to miss the placings from this draw, including three wins, from six starts. Better than last start and can bounce back. SHEERAN MELODY (4) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
